<messaging:emailTemplate subject="A New Resourcing Requirement has been entered" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__ActivityAssignmentDemand__c"><messaging:htmlEmailBody > <html> <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;"> <table width="600px" align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:20px;"> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-style:none;border-bottom-style:solid;border-right-style:none;"><apex:image id="KimbleLogo" value="{!$Setup.KimbleOne__KimbleOneConfigSetting__c.KimbleOne__EmailTemplateLogoURL__c}"/></td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">A new Generic resourcing assignment has been created for assignment {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.Name}.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">Follow the&nbsp;<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+$Page.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignmentDemand+'?id='+relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignmentDemand__c}">Link</apex:outputlink> to view this assignment in Kimble.</td></tr> <tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;"> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Account: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Account__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Engagement: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Element: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__DeliveryElement__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Activity Assignment: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Resource: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__Resource__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Role: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ActivityRole__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Start Date: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__StartDate__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>End Date: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastP3EndDate__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Utilization: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__UtilisationPercentage__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Revenue Rate: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastRevenueRate__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Cost Rate: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastCostRate__c}</td></tr> </table> </td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">Please log in to Kimble to allocate an actual resource. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner.</td> </tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Regards<br/>{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</td> </tr> </table> </body> </html></messaging:htmlEmailBody><messaging:plainTextEmailBody >A new Generic resourcing assignment has been created for assignment{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.Name}. The details are as follows:Account: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Account__c}Engagement: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c}Element: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ResourcedActivity__r.KimbleOne__DeliveryElement__r.Name}Activity Assignment:{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.Name}Resource: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__Resource__r.Name}Role: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ActivityRole__r.Name}Start Date: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__StartDate__c}End Date: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastP3EndDate__c}Utilization: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__UtilisationPercentage__c}Revenue Rate: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastRevenueRate__c}Cost Rate: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__ActivityAssignment__r.KimbleOne__ForecastCostRate__c}Please log in to Kimble to allocate an actual resource. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project ownerRegards{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</messaging:plainTextEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>